{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "EXO",
  "chapter": 6,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the LORD said to Moses, Now shalt thou see what I will do to Pharaoh; for with a strong hand shall he let them go, and with a strong hand shall he drive them from his land.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And God spoke to Moses, and said to him, I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I appeared to Abraham, to Isaac, and to Jacob, by ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the name of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God Almighty, but by my name JEHOVAH was I not known to them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I have also established my covenant with them, to give them the land of Canaan, the land of their pilgrimage, in which they were strangers.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I have also heard the groaning of the children of Israel, whom the Egyptians keep in bondage: and I have remembered my covenant.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore say to the children of Israel, I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD, and I will bring you from under the burdens of the Egyptians, and I will deliver you from their bondage, and I will redeem you with out-stretched arm, and with great judgments:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I will take you to me for a people, and I will be to you a God: and ye shall know that I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD your God, who bringeth you out from under the burdens of the Egyptians.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I will bring you into the land, concerning which I swore to give it to Abraham, to Isaac, and to Jacob; and I will give it to you for a heritage: I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Moses spoke so to the children of Israel: but they hearkened not to Moses, by reason of anguish of spirit, and cruel bondage.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD spoke to Moses, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Go in, speak to Pharaoh, king of Egypt, that he let the children of Israel depart from his land.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Moses spoke before the LORD, saying, Behold, the children of Israel have not hearkened to me; how then shall Pharaoh hear me, who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of uncircumcised lips?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD spoke to Moses, and to Aaron, and gave them a charge to the children of Israel, and to Pharaoh, king of Egypt, to bring the children of Israel out of the land of Egypt.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the heads of their father's houses: The sons of Reuben the first-born of Israel; Hanoch, and Pallu, Hezron, and Carmi: these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the families of Reuben.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Simeon; Jemuel, and Jamin, and Ohad, and Jachin, and Zohar, and Shaul the son of a Canaanitish woman: these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the families of Simeon.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the names of the sons of Levi, according to their generations; Gershon, and Kohath, and Merari. And the years of the life of Levi ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a hundred and thirty-seven years.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Gershon; Libni, and Shimi, according to their families.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Kohath; Amram, and Izhar, and Hebron, and Uzziel: and the years of the life of Kohath ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a hundred and thirty-three years.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Merari; Mahali and Mushi: these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the families of Levi, according to their generations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Amram took him Jochebed, his father's sister, for a wife; and she bore him Aaron and Moses. And the years of the life of Amram ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a hundred and thirty-seven years.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Izhar; Korah, and Nepheg, and Zichri.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Uzziel; Mishael, and Elzaphan, and Zithri.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Aaron took him Elisheba daughter of Amminadab, sister of Naashon, for a wife; and she bore him Nadab and Abihu, Eleazar and Ithamar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Korah; Assir, and Elkanah, and Abiasaph: these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the families of the Korhites.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Eleazar, Aaron's son, took him ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the daughters of Putiel for a wife; and she bore to him Phinehas: these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the heads of the fathers of the Levites, according to their families.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that Aaron and Moses, to whom the LORD said, Bring out the children of Israel from the land of Egypt according to their armies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they who spoke to Pharaoh, king of Egypt, to bring out the children of Israel from Egypt: these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that Moses and Aaron.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, on the day ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "when",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD spoke to Moses in the land of Egypt,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That the LORD spoke to Moses, saying, I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD: speak thou to Pharaoh, king of Egypt, all that I say to thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.6.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EXO.6.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Moses said before the LORD, Behold, I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of uncircumcised lips, and how shall Pharaoh hearken to me?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
